>y <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" negated is \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>ny <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>The year 2020 negated is -2020</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/year","title":"std::chrono::year"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::chrono::year::operator+, std::chrono::year::operator-","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++20. Applies the unary operators to the year value."},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":88,"codeBlockCount":2}
